      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To secure city council funding, frame the West End's density and cultural richness as foundational assets that are currently held back by a lack of modern infrastructure and safety upgrades. Emphasize that drawing entire community neighborhoods on the frontier of edge is great for new business investment, but only if the neighborhood has the capacity to handle the traffic and footfall of higher property values. I recommend writing that the neighborhood's unique charm offers immense economic potential that can be fully unlocked only through targeted revitalization efforts focused on improving housing standards and enhancing public spaces.",
